  "prefLabel": "Pda 707.04 Hearings; Notice of Denial",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 707.04 Hearings; Notice of Denial.\n\n(a) Any hearing required pursuant to Pda 707.03 shall be held by the division director or designee.\n\n(b) If a permit is denied or revoked under Pda 707.03(b) after notice and opportunity for a hearing, notice of the denial or revocation and the reason(s) therefor shall be sent to the applicant in writing within 10 working days of the decision.\n\nSource. #8845, eff 3-21-07; ss by #10949, eff 10-20-15; ss by #14376, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
